#: resources/blocks/accordion-item/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Accordion Item"
msgstr "Akkordeon-Element"

#: resources/blocks/accordion-item/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A single collapsible panel — a header and the content it reveals. Lives "
"inside an Accordion."
msgstr "Ein einzelnes einklappbares Panel — ein Header und der Inhalt, den er aufdeckt. Lebt innerhalb eines Akkordeons."

#: resources/blocks/accordion/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Accordion"
msgstr "Akkordeon"

#: resources/blocks/accordion/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A group of collapsible panels. Custom, fully styleable, with optional single-"
"open mode and animated open/close — powered by the Interactivity API."
msgstr "Eine Gruppe einklappbarer Panels. Anpassbar, vollständig gestaltbar, mit optionalem Einzel-Öffnungs-Modus und animiertem Öffnen/Schließen — basierend auf der Interactivity API."

#: resources/blocks/ai/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Blicks AI"
msgstr "Blicks KI"

#: resources/blocks/ai/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Describe a block in plain language — it is replaced with a configured Blicks "
"block."
msgstr "Beschreibe einen Block in einfacher Sprache — er wird durch einen konfigurierten Blicks-Block ersetzt."

#: resources/blocks/box/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Box"
msgstr "Box"

#: resources/blocks/box/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A generic styled wrapper for cards, panels, and manual layouts."
msgstr "Ein generischer gestalteter Wrapper für Karten, Panels und manuelle Layouts."

#: resources/blocks/button/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Button"
msgstr "Button"

#: resources/blocks/button/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A shadcn-style action button with variants, sizes, links, and optional icons."
msgstr "Ein shadcn-Style-Aktionsbutton mit Varianten, Größen, Links und optionalen Icons."

#: resources/blocks/buttons/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "Buttons"

#: resources/blocks/buttons/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A row or column of Button blocks with shared alignment, spacing, and "
"wrapping."
msgstr "Eine Reihe oder Spalte von Button-Blöcken mit gemeinsamer Ausrichtung, Abständen und Umbruch."

#: resources/blocks/countdown/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Countdown"
msgstr "Countdown"

#: resources/blocks/countdown/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A live countdown timer to a target date — days, hours, minutes, seconds. "
"Powered by the Interactivity API."
msgstr "Ein Live-Countdown-Timer bis zu einem Zieldatum — Tage, Stunden, Minuten, Sekunden. Basierend auf der Interactivity API."

#: resources/blocks/divider/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Divider"
msgstr "Trennlinie"

#: resources/blocks/divider/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A semantic divider for separating content groups."
msgstr "Eine semantische Trennlinie zur Abgrenzung von Inhaltsgruppen."

#: resources/blocks/grid/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "Raster"

#: resources/blocks/grid/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A two-dimensional layout block for equal-width or auto-fit child columns."
msgstr "Ein zweidimensionaler Layout-Block für gleichbreite oder automatisch angepasste untergeordnete Spalten."

#: resources/blocks/heading/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Heading"
msgstr "Überschrift"

#: resources/blocks/heading/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A semantic h1-h6 heading that inherits the active theme by default."
msgstr "Eine semantische h1-h6-Überschrift, die standardmäßig das aktive Theme übernimmt."

#: resources/blocks/icon/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Icon"

#: resources/blocks/icon/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "An inline SVG icon that inherits current text color."
msgstr "Ein Inline-SVG-Icon, das die aktuelle Textfarbe übernimmt."

#: resources/blocks/image/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Bild"

#: resources/blocks/image/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A responsive media block with optional link and caption."
msgstr "Ein responsiver Medien-Block mit optionalem Link und Bildunterschrift."

#: resources/blocks/marquee/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Marquee"
msgstr "Laufschrift"

#: resources/blocks/marquee/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A seamless scrolling marquee — duplicates its inner content and animates "
"with CSS only."
msgstr "Eine nahtlos scrollende Laufschrift — dupliziert ihren Inhalt und animiert nur mit CSS."

#: resources/blocks/modal/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Modal"
msgstr "Modal"

#: resources/blocks/modal/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A button that opens a dialog overlay with custom content. Focus-trapped, ESC/"
"backdrop close, scroll-locked — powered by the Interactivity API."
msgstr "Ein Button, der einen Dialog-Overlay mit benutzerdefiniertem Inhalt öffnet. Fokus-Falle, ESC/Hintergrund-Schließen, Scroll-Sperre — basierend auf der Interactivity API."

#: resources/blocks/notice/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Notice"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: resources/blocks/notice/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A colored message banner (info / success / warning / error) with an icon and "
"an optional dismiss button."
msgstr "Ein farbiges Nachrichten-Banner (Info / Erfolg / Warnung / Fehler) mit einem Icon und optionalem Schließen-Button."

#: resources/blocks/section/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Section"
msgstr "Sektion"

#: resources/blocks/section/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A full-bleed page band with outer section sizing and independent content "
"sizing controls."
msgstr "Ein Seiten-Band über die volle Breite mit äußeren Sektions-Größensteuerungen und unabhängigen Inhalts-Größensteuerungen."

#: resources/blocks/spacer/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Spacer"
msgstr "Abstandshalter"

#: resources/blocks/spacer/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A responsive empty space block for vertical or horizontal rhythm."
msgstr "Ein responsiver Leerblock für vertikalen oder horizontalen Rhythmus."

#: resources/blocks/stack/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Stack"
msgstr "Stack"

#: resources/blocks/stack/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A one-dimensional flex layout for arranging child blocks vertically or "
"horizontally."
msgstr "Ein eindimensionales Flex-Layout zum Anordnen untergeordneter Blöcke vertikal oder horizontal."

#: resources/blocks/tab-headers/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tab Headers"
msgstr "Tab-Header"

#: resources/blocks/tab-headers/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The tab strip — renders and styles the row (or column) of tab buttons. "
"Managed by its parent Tabs block."
msgstr "Der Tab-Streifen — rendert und gestaltet die Reihe (oder Spalte) von Tab-Buttons. Verwaltet durch den übergeordneten Tabs-Block."

#: resources/blocks/tab/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Tab"

#: resources/blocks/tab/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"One tab's content. Managed by its parent Tabs block — its label lives in the "
"tab strip."
msgstr "Der Inhalt eines Tabs. Verwaltet durch den übergeordneten Tabs-Block — sein Label befindet sich im Tab-Streifen."

#: resources/blocks/tabs/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tabs"
msgstr "Tabs"

#: resources/blocks/tabs/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A tabbed interface — a tab strip + content panels, one shown at a time. "
"Keyboard-accessible, powered by the Interactivity API."
msgstr "Eine Tab-Oberfläche — ein Tab-Streifen + Inhaltspanels, eines wird jeweils angezeigt. Tastaturzugänglich, basierend auf der Interactivity API."

#: resources/blocks/text/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

#: resources/blocks/text/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A rich paragraph block for body copy."
msgstr "Ein Rich-Paragraph-Block für Fließtext."

